# Working directory for run_rr_bngl.py (BNGsim vs RoadRunner/AMICI on the BNGL
# corpus -- Figures 4a / 5a of the paper). Everything here is regenerated on every
# run and large/machine-specific, so it is never committed; the figures' committed
# provenance lives in the paper repo (latex/generated/). Mirrors the sibling caches
# ignored by amici_parity/.gitignore (runs/, amici_cache/) and ode_fullnet (/nets/).
#
# cached .net -> SBML exports (~170 MB)
sbml/
# OMEX export intermediates
omex/
# _core parity reports (report_rr_bngl.json / report_amici_bngl.json + smokes)
report_*.json
__pycache__/
